              "name": "SJCOLS"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Had half a watermelon in the fridge and wanted to try something new, this was delicious! Served it with bbq chicken and mexican rice. I recommend dissolving the sugar in the vodka first."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
