            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "utamyb"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this watermelon for a party with a bunch of my girlfriends and it was a HIT! I only had Passion Fruit flavored vodka but it worked out perfectly. I also divvied up the watermelon chunks into ziploc bags while they were chilling so all the pieces were equally soaked and it was so yummy! The mint leaves were perfect!",
            "datePublished": "2011-10-21T14:00:43.540Z"
          },
          {
