            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "After I’d cut up the melon, I found out that I had no vodka, so used Tequila, and that worked out just fine. I even used Splenda, and it still was good. So very simple and fresh, I’d never get tired of this.",
            "datePublished": "2024-04-16T17:13:58.051Z"
