              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Susan Pettibone"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My mint has gone to seed, but I have several varieties of sweet basil - purple, huge leaf, regular - so I chopped up a bunch of tender basil leaves and used them instead. Fabulous!",
            "datePublished": "2015-08-11T11:20:26.840Z"
